    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremia nabomusikalo, nende Gedalia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likhuwa elieetsela Yeremia okhurula khuMWAMI olwa Nebuzaradani omwimilisi wabasikari abalindi yali namalile okhumulekhuula arule eRama; ne yali niyamuyilayo nabohwa neminyololo halala nabaarwa bosi beYerusalemu naYuda abaarwa nibayilwa eBabeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwimilisi wabasikari abalindi yabukula Yeremia, namusunjila mbu OMWAMI Nyasayewo yarumbula akobubii khushialo shino; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khandi OMWAMI yabuleera, nakhola shinga olwa yaboola; shichila mwamwonoonela OMWAMI, nimurahulila amakhuwake ta, niko akachila amakhuwa kano nikamukwila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano, lola, ekhulekhuula inyanga yino, orule muminyololo echili khumakhonoko. Noba noluutsi mbu nobulayi khutsie ninawe eBabeli, kho witse, nasi ndalakhulinda bulayi; nebutswa noba noluutsi mbu nobubii okhutsia ninasi eBabeli, kho oleshei lola, eshialo shiosi shili imbeliwo; aha oluutsi nihali ahalayi okhutsia, ahakhoyeele, kho otsieyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne noba norakalukhayo ta, kho okalushe otsie ewaGedalia waAhikamu waShafani, owa omuruchi waBabeli yayemeeshe abe kafuna wamataala kaYuda, omenye ewuwe mubandu abo; kata otsie hosi hosi aha oluutsi nahakhoyeele okhutsiayo. Mana omwimilisi wabasikari abalindi namukabila omukabo kwebiliibwa, namuheelesia eshihaanwa, namulekhuula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Yeremia natsia ewaGedalia waAhikamu eMizipa, namenya ewuwe mubandu abali nibashisikaale mushialo eshio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaseesia bosi bamahe akali nikachendanga mushialo eshio ebulafu, halala nabandu babwe, olwa bahulila shinga olwa omuruchi waBabeli yali namwemeeshe Gedalia waAhikamu abe kafuna mushialo eshio, nahaanile mumukhonokwe abandu abasaatsa nabakhasi nende abaana, kata nende abokhubamanani abomushialo, khubeenabo abaraarwa okhuyilwa eBabeli ta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kho batsia ewaGedalia eMizipa; mbabano, mbu Ishimaeli waNetsania, naYohanani naYonatsani abaana baKarea, naSeraya waTanahumetsi, nabaana baEfai omuNetofatsi, naYezania womuMaaka, abo nende abandu babwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Gedalia waAhikamu waShafani nabeetsubila, niyeetsubila abandu babwe, ari Murariitsanga okhusiobela abaKalidayo ta; menye mushialo nimukholela omuruchi waBabeli, mana akeenywe kalakaasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasi khulwanje, lole, ndalamenyanga eMizipa, okhumusinjililanga imbeli wabaKalidayo abalakhwitsilanga; neenyu, mukhung'aasie idivai nebiamo ebiengu namafura, mubibiishe munyungu tsieenywe, nimumenya mumataala keenywe aka mubukuule. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi abaYahudi bosi abali eMoabu, nomubaana baAmoni, nomuEdomu kata nende abali mubialo bindi biosi, olwa bahuiila shinga omuruchi waBabeli olwa yali naleshile omusikalo muYuda, khandi shinga olwa yali niyeemeeshe khubo Gedalia waAhikamu waShafani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abaYahudi abo bosi bakalukha okhurula habundu hosi ewa bali nibeelusilibwa, niboola mushialo shiaYuda, ewaGedalia eMizipa, nibakhung'aasia idivai nebiamo ebiengu tsana ebinji muno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obukhobani bwaIshimaeli okhwira Gedalia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Yohanani waKarea nabaseesia bosi bamahe akali nikachendanga mushialo eshio ebulafu nabo niboola ewaGedalia eMizipa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibamusunjila mbu Omanyile mbu Baalisi omuruchi wabaana baAmoni urumile Ishimaeli waNetsania okhukhwira? Nebutswa Gedalia waAhikamu shiyasuubila akabwe ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Yohanani waKarea nasunjila Gedalia eMizipa mabiswi, ari Chama enzie emwire Ishimaeli waNetsania; ne omundu yesi shialamanyakhwo ta. Nishiina eshiakhachila ye akhwire, mana abaYahudi bosi abakhung'aanilanga ewa oli nibasalaasibwa, omusikalo kwaYuda nikusikha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa Gedalia waAhikamu yasunjila Yohanani waKarea mbu Orakhola orio tawe; omuchiikhanga Ishimaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
